1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,694
October eighteenth, nineteen fifty-eight.

2
00:00:03,714 --> 00:00:05,803
Long Island, New York.

3
00:00:05,961 --> 00:00:08,309
A physicist who worked on the atomic bomb

4
00:00:08,329 --> 00:00:11,073
has a much smaller problem: visitors to

5
00:00:11,093 --> 00:00:13,425
his laboratory are getting bored.

6
00:00:13,959 --> 00:00:16,098
So he connects a computer to a five-inch

7
00:00:16,118 --> 00:00:18,776
