8
00:00:19,951 --> 00:00:22,678
Massive lines begin to form.

9
00:00:23,091 --> 00:00:24,889
He never patents it.

10
00:00:25,978 --> 00:00:27,885
Sixty-eight years later, that dot of

11
00:00:27,905 --> 00:00:30,091
light moves more than two hundred billion

12
00:00:30,111 --> 00:00:31,631
