13
00:00:33,026 --> 00:00:35,189
And the entire world is counting down the

14
00:00:35,209 --> 00:00:37,425
days for a single game.

15
00:00:37,249 --> 00:00:40,487
This is the history of video games.

16
00:00:40,917 --> 00:00:45,130
Chapter one. The game nobody patented.

17
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:47,827
It was called Tennis for Two. One line

18
00:00:47,847 --> 00:00:50,520
