20
00:00:52,945 --> 00:00:56,245
A knob for the angle, a button to hit.

21
00:00:56,265 --> 00:00:57,297
Nothing else.

22
00:00:57,426 --> 00:00:59,705
The following year, you could play with

23
00:00:59,725 --> 00:01:02,707
the gravity of the Moon... or Jupiter.

24
00:01:02,814 --> 00:01:06,219
And afterwards, they dismantled it. The

25
