of programmers wrote Spacewar: two ships,

29
00:01:16,674 --> 00:01:19,564
a star in the middle, torpedoes.

30
00:01:20,855 --> 00:01:24,063
It wasn't sold. It was copied. From

31
00:01:24,083 --> 00:01:26,686
