It was overflowing with coins.

54
00:02:19,498 --> 00:02:21,993
It was called Pong.

55
00:02:21,732 --> 00:02:26,363
Chapter three. The fever and the burial.

56
00:02:25,579 --> 00:02:28,090
In nineteen seventy-seven, Atari launched

57
